---
manual: radio.focus
lines: [3356, 3359]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: G9
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  stack do
    @first = radio
    @second = radio
  end
end
----------- test code
# Enter marks the radio; whether a second Enter unmarks it is ledger M27's open question.
second = radio("@second")
second.focus
assert_equal second.linkable_id, focused_drawable&.linkable_id, "focus moves keyboard focus to the radio"

press_key "\n"
assert_equal true, second.checked?, "Enter marks the focused radio"
assert_equal false, radio("@first").checked?
